f <MATH_0016>\nby <MATH_0017>.\nTo construct the map in (2) by the defining property of <MATH_0018>\nwe need to construct a map\n<MATH_0019>\nand such a map exists since by (1) we have\nmaps <MATH_0020> and <MATH_0021>.\nTo construct the map in (3) by the defining property of <MATH_0022>\nwe need to construct a map\n<MATH_0023>\nfor which we use <MATH_0024> where\n<MATH_0025> is the map in (1). To construct the map in (4)\nwe note that we already have the map\n<MATH_0026> by (3).\nThus it suffices to construct a map <MATH_0027>\nand for this we take the element in <MATH_0028>\ncorresponding to the canonical isomorphism <MATH_0029>\nin <MATH_0030>.\nFinally, we come to (5). By the universal property of\n<MATH_0031> it suffices to construct a map\n<MATH_0032>\nWe do this by swapping the last two tensor products using the\ncommutativity constraint and then using the maps\n<MATH_0033> and <MATH_0034>.\n<STRUCT_0009>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:40debaa8bcdbf78572b37597c48cfe838aee75a77aef0317cdaf93ead881fb89", "unit_id": "inventory:categories:0GWJ:remark/0001"}, "state": "READY"}, "inventory:categories:0H17:paragraph/0001": {"context_hash": "sha256:46ea44edd7ba0bb05a10403cca8a5e10699d4f8a123c90c657271ec981347fad", "inventory_id": "inventory:categories:0H17:paragraph/0001", "kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 344874, "byte_start": 344525, "file": "categories.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:10f712edf514533b0c6bf100c02542eedf7459077d77b7274b7791ad24b02a50", "line_end": 9679, "line_start": 9673}, "owner_tag": "0H17", "parent_tag": "0H17", "semantic_path": "paragraph/0001", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0H17", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(2,1)$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-morphisms-section-valuative}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{stacks-more-morphisms-section-formally-smooth}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}